type: dataset
title: "Persona-conditioned audit of LLM brand recommendations in Ukrainian service markets: data and code"
abstract: "Data and code for a counterfactual persona audit of three commercial LLMs on 45 Ukrainian-language consumer queries in insurance, telecommunications and education under nine persona conditions (3,645 answers), with LLM and human annotations of advice content and scripts reproducing the accompanying article."
